This is a beautiful sunrise shot, with warm colours and the people add interest. I did wonder how it might look if the horizon was placed on the lower third. This might balance it even better, highlight the lovely cloud reflections and reduce some of the slightly distracting  darker grey area on the left?</td>', 'This is a beautiful sunrise shot, with warm colours and the people add interest. I did wonder how it might look if the horizon was placed on the lower third. This might balance it even better, highlight the lovely cloud reflections and reduce some of the slightly distracting  darker grey area on the left?', '2025-08-19 12:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
