(7790336, 1297001, 36065, '<td valign="top">
<b>Hey there from the Critique Club</b>
<br/>
<br/><b>My thoughts on the image:</b> I like the depth of the image, and your composition choice here is perfect.  That river really work to pull me into the frame.
<br/>
<br/><b>My ideas for improvement: </b> Something feels off with the depth to me.  I think if the hill faces had been a bit more exposed in the photo joining, this one would have popped for me a bit more.
<br/>
<br/><b>Where I would have/did score this entry:</b> This one was a 6 for me, so I feel the score was pretty accurate.  It was awesome to see the participation in this challenge.  With that came a lot of very strong entries.  Even still, this is a very nice capture!
<br/>
<br/>Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
<br/><b>Eric</b>
<br/></td>', 'Hey there from the Critique Club

My thoughts on the image: I like the depth of the image, and your composition choice here is perfect.  That river really work to pull me into the frame.

My ideas for improvement:  Something feels off with the depth to me.  I think if the hill faces had been a bit more exposed in the photo joining, this one would have popped for me a bit more.

Where I would have/did score this entry: This one was a 6 for me, so I feel the score was pretty accurate.  It was awesome to see the participation in this challenge.  With that came a lot of very strong entries.  Even still, this is a very nice capture!

Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
Eric', '2025-08-26 11:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
